{"id":"c16","stage":2,"title":"邀请与婉拒","scene":"既清楚又礼貌地表达自己的安排。","roles":["敏智","你"],"lines":[{"id":"c16-1","ko":"오늘 저녁에 같이 영화 볼래요?","zh":"今晚要一起看电影吗？","note":"-ㄹ래요 用于询问意愿。","words":[{"term":"오늘","zh":"今天","id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"},{"term":"영화","zh":"电影","id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/0fe832d1dbc3d48884b4.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天","explanation":"오늘修饰저녁。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}]},{"text":"저녁에","meaning":"晚上","explanation":"저녁（晚上）+ 에（时间）。","readings":[{"term":"저녁에","audio":"/audio/adc9d30ae9de01c054e6.mp3"}]},{"text":"같이","meaning":"一起","explanation":"같이表示共同做事。","readings":[{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}]},{"text":"영화","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화是名词，口语中省略宾格助词를。","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}]},{"text":"볼래요?","meaning":"要看吗？","explanation":"보다（看）+ -ㄹ래요（询问对方意愿）。","readings":[{"term":"볼래요","audio":"/audio/eb94d051b3c903fc56af.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c16-2","ko":"미안해요. 오늘은 과제가 많아서요.","zh":"不好意思，我今天作业比较多。","note":"-아서요 在对话中说明原因。","words":[{"term":"미안하다","zh":"抱歉","id":"a3bb8e6d52d69851","audio":"/audio/a3bb8e6d52d6985107bb.mp3"},{"term":"과제","zh":"作业","id":"2c81182794f85e98","audio":"/audio/2c81182794f85e9873c5.mp3"},{"term":"많다","zh":"多","id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/36b4463199ce0e4c594d.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"미안해요.","meaning":"不好意思","explanation":"미안하다（抱歉）的礼貌形式。","readings":[{"term":"미안하다","audio":"/audio/a3bb8e6d52d6985107bb.mp3"}]},{"text":"오늘은","meaning":"今天","explanation":"오늘（今天）+ 은（强调话题）。","readings":[{"term":"오늘은","audio":"/audio/45021ad1ec5b4083b856.mp3"}]},{"text":"과제가","meaning":"作业","explanation":"과제（任务、作业）+ 가（主格）。","readings":[{"term":"과제","audio":"/audio/2c81182794f85e9873c5.mp3"}]},{"text":"많아서요.","meaning":"因为比较多","explanation":"많다（多）+ -아서（原因）+ 요（礼貌）；省略后面的“所以去不了”。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c16-3","ko":"그럼 다음 주는 어때요?","zh":"那下周怎么样？","note":"提出替代时间。","words":[{"term":"다음 주","zh":"下周","id":"78c8f11d2749bd70","audio":"/audio/78c8f11d2749bd70d010.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/434130c6274493ef5696.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么","explanation":"그러면的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}]},{"text":"다음","meaning":"下一个","explanation":"다음修饰주。","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}]},{"text":"주는","meaning":"周","explanation":"주（周）+ 는（话题）。","readings":[{"term":"주는","audio":"/audio/f2dcf42e42a4682a9877.mp3"}]},{"text":"어때요?","meaning":"怎么样？","explanation":"어떻다的礼貌形式，用来提出替代方案。","readings":[{"term":"어때요","audio":"/audio/6dbf157a4dc7e6e8b537.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c16-4","ko":"금요일까지 끝낼 수 있을 것 같아요.","zh":"我应该能在周五之前完成。","note":"-ㄹ 것 같다 表示推测。","words":[{"term":"금요일","zh":"星期五","id":"a594e9b583050ec4","audio":"/audio/a594e9b583050ec46ff9.mp3"},{"term":"끝내다","zh":"完成","id":"686f8e089bf22cd0","audio":"/audio/686f8e089bf22cd01d10.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/f451f2c88dbfb04fe2bf.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"금요일까지","meaning":"到星期五为止","explanation":"금요일（星期五）+ 까지（截止点）。","readings":[{"term":"금요일","audio":"/audio/a594e9b583050ec46ff9.mp3"}]},{"text":"끝낼","meaning":"完成","explanation":"끝내다（完成）+ -ㄹ，修饰수。","readings":[{"term":"끝내다","audio":"/audio/686f8e089bf22cd01d10.mp3"}]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可能／能力","explanation":"수为依存名词，-(으)ㄹ 수 있다表示能够。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}]},{"text":"있을","meaning":"能","explanation":"있다 + -을，与것 같다组成推测。","readings":[{"term":"있을","audio":"/audio/e77f5d4b360ff618b52e.mp3"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"事情","explanation":"것在-(으)ㄹ 것 같다中构成推测表达。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}]},{"text":"같아요.","meaning":"应该","explanation":"같다的礼貌形式；끝낼 수 있을 것 같아요意为“应该能完成”。","readings":[{"term":"같아요","audio":"/audio/d27f58354e12c6dc5616.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c16-5","ko":"그럼 토요일로 정해요.","zh":"那就定在星期六吧。","note":"-(으)로 标示确定的选择。","words":[{"term":"정하다","zh":"决定","id":"2b712f8bfe2006eb","audio":"/audio/2b712f8bfe2006ebd91d.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/38461ab4d3608cc3cf77.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那","explanation":"그러면的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}]},{"text":"토요일로","meaning":"定为星期六","explanation":"토요일（星期六）+ 로（选定的结果）。","readings":[{"term":"토요일로","audio":"/audio/ee9ab01d10e362eecac5.mp3"}]},{"text":"정해요.","meaning":"决定吧","explanation":"정하다（定下）→ 정해요；此处为提议。","readings":[{"term":"정하다","audio":"/audio/2b712f8bfe2006ebd91d.mp3"}]}]},{"id":"c16-6","ko":"이해해 줘서 고마워요.","zh":"谢谢你的理解。","note":"-아/어 줘서 고맙다：感谢对方做某事。","words":[{"term":"이해하다","zh":"理解","id":"fc001754fa34535b","audio":"/audio/fc001754fa34535b35d4.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/19dacf4f73f7dbf99041.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"이해해","meaning":"理解","explanation":"이해하다（理解）→ 이해해，连接주다。","readings":[{"term":"이해하다","audio":"/audio/fc001754fa34535b35d4.mp3"}]},{"text":"줘서","meaning":"因为你为我做了","explanation":"주다 + -어서 → 줘서；-아/어 줘서指出对方的帮助。","readings":[{"term":"줘서","audio":"/audio/6a49f678e25ad667e726.mp3"}]},{"text":"고마워요.","meaning":"谢谢","explanation":"고맙다的礼貌形式；整体表达“谢谢你理解我”。","readings":[{"term":"고마워요","audio":"/audio/3f7c2c9d4d32045f28cd.mp3"}]}]}],"day":76,"sequenceScore":1.4934,"questions":[{"lineIndex":2,"options":["那下周怎么样？","今晚要一起看电影吗？","不好意思，我今天作业比较多。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":4,"options":["今晚要一起看电影吗？","那就定在星期六吧。","不好意思，我今天作业比较多。"],"answer":1}]}
